284", "url_private_html": "https://figshare.com/account/articles/19331284", "url_public_html": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/Viral_infectivity_and_titers_following_adsorption_by_reovirus_virions_and_ISVPs_/19331284", "timeline": {"posted": "2022-03-09T18:30:20", "publisherPublication": "2022-03-09T18:30:03", "firstOnline": "2022-03-09"}, "resource_title": "Reovirus infection is regulated by NPC1 and endosomal cholesterol homeostasis", "resource_doi": "10.1371/journal.ppat.1010322"}